<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 3 T-bill issues for 42 bln levs.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 3 T-bill issues for 42 bln levs.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed three special issues of discount T-bills worth a total of 42 billion levs and yielding 18.27, 18.30 and 19.05 percent to maturity, respectively, the central bank said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the central bank did not say with which financial institution or institutions the issues were placed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Details of issues follow. Prices percent of par.</p>
<p> Issue number	    BG3025797005  BG3025897003  BG3025997001</p>
<p> Type			discount	discount	discount</p>
<p> Term			33 days	 32 days	 36 days</p>
<p> Issue date		April 3	 April 3	 April 3</p>
<p> Maturity date	   May 6	   May 5	   May 9</p>
<p> Par value		 12 bln levs   15 bln levs   15 bln levs</p>
<p> Selling price	   84.55 pct     84.53	   84.00 pct</p>
<p> Avg yield to maturity 18.27 pct     18.30	   19.05 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
